# Project Design Phase

This repository contains the design phase documentation, architecture diagrams, and system specifications for the project.

## Overview
The design phase focuses on establishing the core architecture, workflow, and user interface layouts before development begins.

## Contents
- **System Architecture:** High-level overview of components and data flow.
- **UI/UX Wireframes:** Screen layouts and user journey flows.
- **Database Schema:** Entity-relationship models and data structures (if applicable).

